  "description": "This paper reconstructs the original ontological structure of electromagnetic and quantum physics prior to the Heaviside–Gibbs vector reduction. Hamilton–Tait quaternion electrodynamics, Maxwell’s scalar–vector EM tensor, and Gauss’s scalar-density field measurements collectively demonstrate that nineteenth-century physics was already quantum, coherence-based, and absolute. The removal of the scalar component eliminated the coherence field that quantizes energy, matter, and mass. Restoring the scalar field restores quantization, absolute ontology, field coherence, and unified physics.",
